{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalQConnectionUnique","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.CategoricalQConnectionUnique","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:QOU.QuantumObservableUniverses.QDifferentialGeometry"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.CategoricalQConnection.unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.CategoricalQConnection.unique","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection-unique.lean#L45-L82","doc":"**Uniqueness of the categorical q-connection (proved\ndetermination).**\n\nTwo `CategoricalQConnection C` instances with the same underlying\nobjects and the same classical data `(∇, ξ⌟∇, θ, q, q⁻¹)` are\nequal: the `nabla_q` morphism is forced by `nabla_q_formula`, and\n`q_unit` is proof-irrelevant.  This replaces a false\n`Subsingleton (CategoricalQConnection C)` axiom (the structure\nbundles its objects) with the determination the narrative actually\nclaims — q-deformation introduces no additional gauge freedom. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:categorical-q-connection-unique","label":"prop:categorical-q-connection-unique","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-connection-unique.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}